<div class="flash-messages board-page-flash" aria-live="polite"><p :for={{kind, message} <- @flash} class={"flash #{kind}"}>{message}</p></div>
<div id="nook-ui" phx-hook="Whiteboard" phx-update="ignore">
<main id="landing">
  <nav class="landing-nav"><a href="/" aria-label="Nook home"><img class="brand" src="/assets/nook-logo.png" alt="Nook"></a><span>A little room for big ideas.</span><Layouts.account_nav current_scope={@current_scope} /><button class="primary" phx-click="create_board">Open a whiteboard <span>↗</span></button></nav>
  <section class="hero"><img class="hero-wordmark" src="/assets/nook-logo.png" alt="Nook"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> YOUR IDEAS. ALL IN ONE PLACE.</div><h1>Make room<br>for <em>what’s next.</em></h1><p>A simple, collaborative space to bring ideas together.<br>Start with a thought. See where it takes you.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="primary large" phx-click="create_board">Start a quick board <span>↗</span></button><button class="secondary large" id="join-open">Join a room</button></div><p class="hero-footnote">No account needed. Quick boards expire after {@guest_days} days of inactivity.</p></section>
  <section class="board-preview" aria-label="A preview of your creative space"><div class="preview-top"><span>↖ &nbsp; Your next great idea</span><span>● &nbsp; A space to think freely</span></div><div class="preview-canvas"><div class="sample-text">Good things start<br>with a small idea.</div><div class="sample-note"><span>THE STARTING POINT</span><strong>What if we tried<br>something new?</strong><span>Make a little room to explore. ✧</span></div><div class="sample-idea">✧<br><strong>A fresh perspective</strong><br><small>Connect the dots.</small></div><div class="sample-task">☑ &nbsp; Bring everyone together</div><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M470 135 C560 135 520 165 620 165"/><path d="M750 200 C750 260 530 210 530 260"/></svg></div><div class="preview-bottom">Text &nbsp; · &nbsp; Notes &nbsp; · &nbsp; Shapes &nbsp; · &nbsp; Tasks &nbsp; · &nbsp; Connections<span>One canvas. Endless possibilities.</span></div></section>
  <section id="recent-boards" class="recent-boards" hidden aria-labelledby="recent-title"><h2 id="recent-title">Recent boards on this device</h2><p>This list belongs to this browser. Temporary boards still expire; access permissions still apply.</p><ul id="recent-list"></ul></section>
  <footer><span>Less clutter. More possibility.</span><span>Made for the way ideas happen.</span></footer>
</main>
<main id="workspace" hidden>
  <section id="board-load-state" class="board-load-state" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true" hidden><h2 id="load-title">Opening your board…</h2><p id="load-detail">Bringing your ideas together.</p><div id="load-actions" hidden><button class="primary" id="retry-load">Try again</button><a href="/">Back to home</a></div></section>
  <p id="connection-notice" class="connection-notice" role="status" hidden>Connection interrupted. You can keep editing; changes will sync when you reconnect.</p>
  <header class="app-header"><a class="logo-link" href="/" aria-label="Nook home"><img class="brand" src="/assets/nook-logo.png" alt="Nook"></a><span class="header-divider"></span><input id="board-title" aria-label="Board title" value="Untitled board" maxlength="120"><div class="history-controls" aria-label="Undo and redo"><button id="undo" disabled aria-label="Undo" title="Nothing to undo">↶</button><button id="redo" disabled aria-label="Redo" title="Nothing to redo">↷</button></div><span id="save-status" role="status">Connecting…</span><div class="header-right"><Layouts.account_nav current_scope={@current_scope} /><button id="collaborators" class="secondary" title="People in this room">1 here</button><span id="request-count" aria-live="polite"></span><button id="help" class="workspace-help" aria-haspopup="dialog">Help</button><button class="primary" id="share-button">Invite <span>↗</span></button></div></header>
  <div id="access-message" hidden><h2>This board is unavailable.</h2><p id="access-reason"></p><a href="/dashboard">My boards</a> · <a href="/">Home</a></div>
  <div id="canvas" role="region" aria-keyshortcuts="Enter Escape Control+a Control+g" tabindex="0" aria-label="Whiteboard. Choose a tool, then click to place. Right-drag to pan. Drag empty space to select."><div id="world"><svg id="connections" aria-label="Connections"></svg><div id="elements"></div></div><div id="empty-hint" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
  <aside id="history-notice" class="history-notice" hidden><p id="history-feedback" role="status"></p><button id="history-dismiss" aria-label="Dismiss undo message">×</button></aside>
  <aside id="overlap-notice" class="overlap-notice" hidden><p role="status">This item grew into another item. You can move them apart; nothing was moved automatically.</p><button id="dismiss-overlap">Dismiss</button></aside>
  <aside id="selection-bar" hidden aria-label="Element options">
    <button id="custom-colors">Colors</button><button id="select-underneath" hidden title="Temporarily hide this item and reveal its overlaps">Select underneath</button><button id="delete" title="Delete selected element">Delete</button><button id="more-options" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="advanced-options">More options</button>
    <div id="advanced-options" class="advanced-options" hidden aria-label="More item options">
      <button id="duplicate" title="Duplicate (Ctrl+D)">Duplicate</button><label id="font-size-control" hidden>Text size <input id="font-size" type="number" min="12" max="72" step="1" value="16" aria-label="Text size" /></label>      <label id="text-color-control" hidden>Text color <select id="text-color" aria-label="Text color"><option value="purple">Purple</option><option value="charcoal">Charcoal</option><option value="violet">Violet</option><option value="white">White</option></select></label>
      <button id="change-shape" hidden>Change shape</button><button id="change-icon" hidden>Change icon</button><button id="lock-position">Lock position</button><button id="reset-ends" hidden>Reset connection ends</button><button id="fit-text" hidden>Fit height</button><button id="make-text-fit" hidden>Make text fit</button><button id="group">Group</button><button id="ungroup">Ungroup</button><button id="attach-file" hidden>Replace file</button><button id="send-back" title="Send backward">Send backward</button><button id="bring-front" title="Bring forward">Bring forward</button>
      <span id="selection-count" role="status"></span>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <div id="tool-dock" aria-label="Creation tools">
  <button id="tools-toggle" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="toolbar">Hide tools</button><span id="active-tool" hidden></span>
  <nav id="toolbar" aria-label="Whiteboard tools" aria-describedby="tool-hint"></nav>
  </div>
  <aside id="reveal-controls" hidden aria-label="Revealing covered items"><span id="reveal-count" role="status"></span><button id="finish-reveal">Show hidden items</button></aside>
  <aside id="icon-menu" class="visual-panel" hidden aria-label="Choose an icon"><label>Find an icon <input id="icon-search" type="search" placeholder="Search icons" /></label><p>Arrow is a symbol; use Connect for attached lines. Document is a symbol; use File to upload.</p><div id="icon-results"></div><button id="close-icons">Close</button></aside>
  <aside id="color-menu" class="visual-panel" hidden aria-label="Choose colors"><label>Apply to <select id="color-target"><option value="color">Fill / icon / ink</option><option value="text_color">Text</option></select></label><div id="color-palette"></div><label>Custom color… <input id="color-wheel" type="color" value="#ad7bfa" /></label><button id="apply-color">Apply custom color</button><div id="recent-colors" aria-label="Recently used colors"></div><p id="color-warning" role="status"></p><button id="close-colors">Close</button></aside>
  <aside id="shape-menu" hidden aria-label="Choose a shape"><button data-shape="rectangle">▭<span>Rectangle</span></button><button data-shape="rounded">▢<span>Rounded</span></button><button data-shape="circle">○<span>Circle</span></button><button data-shape="triangle">△<span>Triangle</span></button><button data-shape="diamond">◇<span>Diamond</span></button></aside>
  <div class="zoom-controls"><button id="mode-select" aria-pressed="true" title="Drag empty space to select items">Select</button><button id="mode-hand" aria-pressed="false" title="Drag empty space to move your view">Hand</button><button id="navigation-settings-toggle" aria-label="Navigation settings" aria-expanded="false">⚙</button><div id="navigation-settings" hidden><label>Navigation device <select id="navigation-mode" aria-label="Navigation mode" title="Mouse: wheel zoom. Trackpad: two-finger pan and pinch zoom."><option value="mouse">Mouse</option><option value="trackpad">Trackpad</option></select></label><label><input id="snap-enabled" type="checkbox" checked /> Alignment guides and snapping (hold Alt to bypass)</label></div><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button id="zoom-reset" title="Reset view">100%</button><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><span></span><button id="fit" title="Show everything" aria-label="Show everything">⌖</button></div>
  
</main>
<dialog id="invite-dialog" aria-label="Invite someone"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form><h2>Invite someone to this board.</h2><p>Anyone with this link can edit this board.</p><button id="quick-copy-invite" class="primary">Copy invitation link</button><p id="invite-feedback" role="status"></p><label for="quick-invite-link" id="invite-link-label" hidden>Invitation link</label><input id="quick-invite-link" readonly hidden /><button class="secondary" id="more-sharing">More sharing options</button></dialog>
<dialog id="room-dialog" aria-label="Room and invitations"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form><h2>People and room access.</h2><section class="room-section"><h3>People in this room</h3><ul id="participants" aria-live="polite"></ul><form id="name-form"><label for="participant-name">YOUR DISPLAY NAME</label><div class="copy-row"><input id="participant-name" maxlength="40" required><button class="secondary" type="submit">Update name</button></div></form></section><label for="room-code">ROOM CODE</label><div class="copy-row"><input id="room-code" readonly><button class="secondary" id="copy-code">Copy</button></div><p>Visitors using this code need your approval. An invitation link lets them join directly.</p><section id="room-owner-controls" class="room-section" hidden><label class="room-toggle"><input id="room-open" type="checkbox"> Allow room-code requests</label><p class="fine-print">Requests expire after ten minutes.</p><h3>Waiting to join</h3><ul id="requests" aria-live="polite"></ul></section><details id="advanced-sharing"><summary>More sharing options</summary><label for="room-link">INVITATION LINK</label><div class="copy-row"><input id="room-link" readonly placeholder="Use Invite to get a link"><button class="primary" id="copy-link">Copy link</button></div><div :if={@board && @board["can_manage"]} class="invite-actions"><button class="primary" id="create-invite">Replace invitation</button><button class="secondary" id="disable-sharing">Disable sharing</button></div><p>Replacing an invitation or disabling sharing removes current guest access. Only the owner can manage invitations.</p></details></dialog>
<dialog id="sharing-confirm-dialog" aria-label="Confirm sharing change"><h2 id="sharing-confirm-title"></h2><p>Current guests will lose access. Their saved work stays on the board. You can invite them again afterward.</p><div class="invite-actions"><button class="secondary" id="sharing-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" id="sharing-confirm">Continue</button></div></dialog>
<dialog id="join-dialog" aria-label="Join a room"><form id="join-form" phx-submit="join_room"><button class="dialog-close" type="button" id="close-join" aria-label="Close">×</button><div class="eyebrow">THERE’S ROOM FOR YOU</div><h2>Join a room.</h2><p>Enter a room code or paste an invitation link.</p><label for="join-name">YOUR DISPLAY NAME</label><input id="join-name" name="name" maxlength="40" placeholder="How should we call you?" autocomplete="nickname"><label for="join-code">ROOM CODE OR LINK</label><input id="join-code" name="code" required autocomplete="off" placeholder="Paste a code or invitation link"><p id="join-error" role="alert"></p><button class="primary large" type="submit">Join whiteboard ↗</button></form></dialog>
<dialog id="help-dialog" aria-label="Help"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form><h2>Help</h2>  <aside :if={@board} class="board-lifecycle" aria-label="Board lifetime">
    <%= if @board["kind"] == "guest" do %>
      <span>Temporary board · Saved automatically · Expires after {@guest_days} days without activity</span>
      <button :if={@board["can_claim"]} id="claim-board" phx-click="claim_board">Keep this board</button>
      <a :if={@board["can_manage"] && !@current_scope} href={"/save/#{@code}"}>Keep this board — create an account</a>
    <% else %>
      <span>Permanent board · {if @board["sharing_active"], do: "shared with guests", else: "private"}</span>
    <% end %>
  </aside>
<button id="name-board" class="name-board" hidden title="Give this board a name so you can find it later">Name this board</button><section class="help-current-tool"><h3>Using the current tool</h3><p id="tool-hint">Drag a tool onto the board, or click it to place.</p></section><p>Drag a tool onto the canvas, or click it and then click to place. Hover Shapes or Icons to choose a variant. Double-click empty canvas to start a text box. In Select mode, click written text to type. Drag any empty part of an item to move it; written text stays available for editing. Click without dragging to edit a card. Moving and resizing leave the item selected. With the keyboard, choose a tool, Tab to the canvas and press Enter to place it. New objects focus their editor automatically.</p><dl><dt>Draw</dt><dd>Choose Draw next to Select and Hand. Pick ink and brush size, then drag to draw. Each completed stroke saves as one undoable action. Escape returns to Select; select a stroke to move, resize, group, duplicate, recolor or delete it. Right-drag still pans. A tap makes a dot. Pause at the end while holding to straighten a line, then move its endpoint and release. Undo first restores the rough line. In Draw mode, Group strokes lets you drag a box to group enclosed strokes automatically. Select a recognizable drawing and choose Clean up shape; Undo restores its original sketch before removing it. Cleanup supports lines, boxes, triangles, diamonds, ovals, arrows, and a face drawn as an outline, two eyes and a smile. Colors opens the shared standard palette; the custom picker remains available. Escape cancels an unfinished stroke.</dd><dt>Undo / Redo</dt><dd>Use the arrow buttons or Ctrl / ⌘ + Z and Ctrl / ⌘ + Shift + Z. Your last 50 actions are kept in this tab, including through refresh. Offline undo changes are checked and synced when you reconnect.</dd><dt>Workspace tools</dt><dd>Hide tools frees canvas space; Tools reopens the toolbar. Right-click any item to open More options. For shapes, choose Change shape. Icons are visual symbols; File uploads real files.</dd><dt>Colors and alignment</dt><dd>Colors offers a palette and custom picker. Navigation settings controls alignment guides and snapping; hold Alt to bypass snapping. Lock position under More options prevents movement and manual resizing, while words remain editable.</dd><dt>Pan</dt><dd>Hand pans over items as well as empty space without editing them. You can also right-drag, Space + drag, middle mouse, or two-finger trackpad scroll</dd><dt>Zoom</dt><dd>Mouse wheel for fine zoom. Open Navigation settings and choose Trackpad for two-finger panning and pinch zoom.</dd><dt>Edit</dt><dd>Click written text to edit. Text and notes keep their width, wrap, and grow downward as needed. Finishing an edit or deleting words never shrinks them. Shapes resize only when you resize them. Enter adds an item in a checklist; Backspace removes an empty item.</dd><dt>Resize</dt><dd>Drag the selected element’s bottom-right handle</dd><dt>Connect</dt><dd>Choose Connect, then drag from one object to another. Drag a selected line’s endpoint to adjust it.</dd><dt>Select</dt><dd>Left-drag empty space for a selection box; Ctrl / ⌘-click adds or removes objects. Ctrl / ⌘ + A selects all. Drag an icon from its center or edges. For covered items, select the cover and choose Select underneath. It disappears only in your view. Click an outlined item or its label, then drag blank space or edit its text. The cover stays hidden while that item remains selected, including during editing and dragging. Click empty canvas or select a different item to restore the cover automatically. Show hidden items or Escape also finishes the selection. Reveal deeper hides another cover. No saved layers change.</dd><dt>Group</dt><dd>Ctrl / ⌘ + G to group; Ctrl / ⌘ + Shift + G to ungroup</dd><dt>Nudge</dt><dd>Arrow keys move the selection; Shift moves ten pixels</dd><dt>Checklist order</dt><dd>Drag an item’s handle, or Ctrl / ⌘ + Up / Down while editing an item</dd><dt>Duplicate</dt><dd>Ctrl / ⌘ + D</dd><dt>Delete</dt><dd>Delete / Backspace</dd><dt>Cancel</dt><dd>Escape</dd></dl></dialog>
<dialog id="conflict-dialog" aria-labelledby="conflict-title"><div class="eyebrow">LET’S KEEP EVERYONE’S IDEAS</div><h2 id="conflict-title">Review this change.</h2><p id="conflict-message"></p><div class="conflict-comparison"><section><h3>Current board</h3><pre id="conflict-current"></pre></section><section><h3>Your draft</h3><pre id="conflict-draft"></pre></section></div><div class="invite-actions"><button class="secondary" id="conflict-current-button">Use current board</button><button class="primary" id="conflict-keep">Keep my version</button></div></dialog>
<input type="file" id="file-input" hidden accept="image/*,.pdf,.txt,.md,.csv">
<div id="toast" role="status" hidden></div>
</div>
